# Snyk (https://snyk.io) policy file, patches or ignores known vulnerabilities.
version: v1.5.0
ignore:
  SNYK-JS-BRACES-19963945:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          No upstream fix is published yet (latest braces release is 3.0.3,
          2024-05-21). braces is pulled in transitively via
          sass -> @parcel/watcher -> micromatch, and is only used at build
          time by the Sass file watcher during asset compilation - it never
          runs against attacker-controlled input in production. Revisit and
          remove this ignore once a patched braces version is released.
        expires: 2026-12-30T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-JS-PICOMATCH-21248802:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          No upstream fix is published yet (latest picomatch 2.x release is
          2.3.2; micromatch@latest still pins picomatch ^2.3.1). picomatch is
          pulled in transitively via the same chain as the braces ignore
          above - sass -> @parcel/watcher -> micromatch - and is only used at
          build time by the Sass file watcher during asset compilation, never
          against attacker-controlled input in production. Revisit and remove
          this ignore once a patched picomatch version is released.
        expires: 2026-12-30T00:00:00.000Z
patch: {}
